{"title":"中山市印发《中山市智慧工地评价指引（试行）》的通知","date":"2026-07-14","content":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">中山市印发《中山市智慧工地评价指引（试行）》的通知</span></strong></p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"72334\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;z-index:2;margin-bottom:-15px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:32px;margin-left:15px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(240, 249, 255);border:1.5px solid rgb(134, 207, 255);border-radius:8px;padding:28px 15px 25px;z-index:1;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<p style=\"font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans CN&quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 1.75em; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 17px; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-support&quot;:&quot;96编辑器&quot;,&quot;data-style-id&quot;:&quot;72334&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom:unset;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;background-color:rgb(240, 249, 255);border:1.5px solid rgb(134, 207, 255);border-radius:8px;padding:28px 15px 25px;z-index:1;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;text-align: center;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" leaf=\"\">关于印发《中山市智慧工地评价指引（试行）》的通知</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t<p style=\"font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans CN&quot;, sans-serif;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t<p style=\"font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans CN&quot;, sans-serif;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t火炬开发区管委会，翠亨新区管委会，各镇政府、街道办事处，各有关单位：</p>\r\n\t\t<p style=\"font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans CN&quot;, sans-serif;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t为深入贯彻落实国家、省关于推动智能建造与建筑工业化协同发展的战略部署，规范和引导我市智慧工地建设，提升工程质量安全管理水平和建筑行业数字化转型能力，依据《住房和城乡建设部等部门关于推动智能建造与建筑工业化协同发展的指导意见》（建市〔2020〕60号）等文件要求，结合我市实际，我局制定了《中山市智慧工地评价指引（试行）》，现印发实施，自本通知印发之日起受理评价申请。实施过程中遇到的问题，请径向我局反映。</p>\r\n\t\t<p style=\"font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans CN&quot;, sans-serif;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t特此通知。</p>\r\n\t\t<p indenttext=\"　　\" noextractcontent=\"true\" style=\"font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans CN&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t<p indenttext=\"　　\" noextractcontent=\"true\" style=\"font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans CN&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t<p style=\"font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans CN&quot;, sans-serif;text-align:right;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t中山市住房和城乡建设局</p>\r\n\t\t<p style=\"font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans CN&quot;, sans-serif;text-align:right;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t2026年6月30日</p>\r\n\t\t<p indenttext=\"　　\" noextractcontent=\"true\" style=\"font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans CN&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t<p style=\"font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans CN&quot;, sans-serif;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t（联系方式：建设科技科，88337746）</p>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(65, 180, 255);\">附&nbsp; 件</b></span></p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><a class=\"weapp_text_link\" data-miniprogram-appid=\"wx554ecad391d8c7a5\" data-miniprogram-nickname=\"简文档\" data-miniprogram-path=\"pages/doc/doc?uuid=57f25a7397654e9791e1384583b41c29&amp;sid=71666485\" data-miniprogram-servicetype=\"\" data-miniprogram-type=\"text\" style=\"white-space-collapse: collapse;\">中山市智慧工地评价指引（试行）.pdf</a></span></p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\">1、